# Sample footage, in every container the analyze endpoint accepts.
# Uppercase too: dashcams write .MP4 / .MOV, and a case-sensitive checkout
# (Linux, or macOS with core.ignorecase off) would not match them otherwise.
*.mp4
*.MP4
*.mov
*.MOV
*.avi
*.mkv
*.m4v
